MTD	title	TCA Concentrations in Muscle Tissue of Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia (part II)
MTD	description	TCA Concentrations of Muscle Wasting in Cancer Cachexia. Muscle samples from 10 control patients, 10 weight stable pancreatic cancer patients, and 10 pancreatic cancer patients with significant weight loss. Samples are divided evenly between males and females.
